      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `22faeae6da76698d76361c5b8553d76af2616e22741db3e0f9783b7f31de8635--45100do006_2008.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2008\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 7753dea8a89db0b96783b1d9353fd7eac9372453bd5922fbd6e8e4955294afc2 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 6f22cce595b648a3a321b89557c0006d205a878a5d9b86c2b010013d18be5f15 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 6f2c692790ab6ea05f4467abcea4e90f251bd404c32fb333c8790bea26c89286 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | f38e724f51f50668bddbcf582332792e70466b1338f86a811c17055acc320b31 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 87a2d3c7743bb75c0966ad1dc89eca1d5ad8f8a5e71fd62bdff80954d4596158 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 63e28b6be768278cbff76104f7b14d1ec2a41d4094aa3fbde409e0a6246917ae | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 2976a6d360085693b5a880d3983b7a1519f9b5cacc040933054a4a004fb768b1 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | bba039bdd1803f6f84894bee1ae3df3d9318d40222ce958af4528e0b4ac63add | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 3f021b543d08e0f334a2637369aa4231ea3c4ae71a675a5999c5b388f5956ee4 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
